uch as hanging from a flying fin, or firing themselves from saltheap cannons. Those who survive tend to go to even more extreme lengths to satisfy their thirst for danger.","abilities":["Movement Speed increases briefly when crossing a Rope Bridge or launched by a <Saltheap Cannon>"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.9,"stats":{"hp":6500,"atk":420,"def":60,"res":10,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":2}},"rum_gourmet":{"slug":"rum_gourmet","name":"Rum Gourmet","icon":"/enemies-icons/Rum Gourmet.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Sailors recommend their favorite things to each other, including rum. Not that rum needs recommending to begin with—everyone on the crew understands how valuable it is out on the flat, and would love to share it at any time.","abilities":["Movement Speed increases when carrying a Booze Barrel","First attack consumes Booze Barrel to deal heavy Physical damage and create an area where enemies gain increased ASPD and Physical Dodge"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.5,"stats":{"hp":10500,"atk":1000,"def":500,"res":20,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":3}},"bel_canto_boatswain":{"slug":"bel_canto_boatswain","name":"Bel Canto Boatswain","icon":"/enemies-icons/Bel Canto Boatswain.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee and Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"The boatswain's saltfin has caught the sailors' attention, but it does not stop bellowing when the boatswain wants it to. Forced to yell above the saltfin's cacophony, the boatswain has developed a bel canto voice so beautiful that it may impress the salt flat itself.","abilities":["While on the battlefield, <Risk-surviving Sailor> attacks also inflict Corrosion; Periodically summons 2 <Risk-surviving Sailors>","ATK increases when blocked"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.45,"stats":{"hp":30000,"atk":850,"def":800,"res":30,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":3}},"explosion_devotee":{"slug":"explosion_devotee","name":"Explosion Devotee","icon":"/enemies-icons/Explosion Devotee.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"The Saltheap Cannon is driven not by Originium explosives, but by the kinetic power of saltfin sinew. Dissatisfied with this state of affairs, some sailors have taken to stuffing massive amounts of improvised powder into metal tubes, trying to light up the night sky of the Salt Flat.","abilities":["Can perform a charged attack, dealing a large amount of Arts Damage to all nearby allied units with a Stun effect","Can ride <Saltfin Breakers>, gaining some of their abilities"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":15000,"atk":420,"def":300,"res":50,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":2.5}},"saltfin_breaker":{"slug":"saltfin_breaker","name":"Saltfin Breaker","icon":"/enemies-icons/Saltfin Breaker.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Despite its size and weight, this saltfin is surprisingly lithe when swimming through the salts. Normally gentle in nature, it can shatter even hardened ancient salt layers with its powerful slamming attacks when provoked.","abilities":["Attacks deal Physical splash damage to all nearby allied units","Immune to the effects of Salt Flat and gains increased Movement Speed while in Salt Flat"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.3,"stats":{"hp":100000,"atk":2000,"def":0,"res":0,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":6}},"anastasio_the_atoner":{"slug":"anastasio_the_atoner","name":"Anastasio, the Atoner","icon":"/enemies-icons/Anastasio, the Atoner.webp","rank":"Boss","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee and Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Anastasio has died. Anastasio rises again. He lives to atone for the sins ingrained in his very nature. He envies both the innocent for living and the sinner for dying, for it is not his place to either live with integrity or die in peace.","abilities":["Performs ranged attacks when unblocked, dealing Physical damage to the target and all allied units within the 8 surrounding tiles","[Gospel Spray] Fires within range 10 times, dealing Physical damage and Corrosion to the target and surrounding allied units, prioritizing allies with the lowest total Corrosion","First Form","Immune to the effects of Salt Flat, and takes far less Physical and Arts damage when in the surrounding 8 tiles around a <Saltheap Cannon>","[Inquisition of Sin] Buffs a <Saltheap Cannon> within Attack Range, increasing its splash area for a period of time","The first time HP drops to 0, jumps to a fixed spot and enters second form, summoning a <Saltheap Cannon>","Second Form","Immune to Stun; gains increased Movement Speed and ASPD","When another enemy appears, gains increased ATK, but loses HP per second for a period of time","When not blocked, takes significantly reduced Physical and Arts damage; when blocked, causes all <Saltheap Cannons> to target the location of the blocker","[Heart-Piercing Salvation] Whenever a certain amount of HP is lost, passes through the unit blocking him, dealing Physical damage to units along the path"],"levelCount":2,"level":1,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.3,"stats":{"hp":70000,"atk":1500,"def":600,"res":40,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":5}},"bridge_holder":{"slug":"bridge_holder","name":"Bridge Holder","icon":"/enemies-icons/Bridge Holder.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"M